From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_eth_hnat: harden SER fault recovery and
 add PCE/EIP-197 inline glue

Synchronize SER reset fault recovery between mtk_eth_soc and mtk_hnat, and add inline PCE and EIP-197 crypto offload integration hooks.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
